  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "That night, the traveller stayed alone in the temple by the shore."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Morning has come!"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "He is alive!"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Rannamaari became a story of fear, faith, and transformation in Malé."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "(reciting Qur’an)"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "The truth is greater"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "than fear."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Teach us your faith."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "I will."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "The wind howled. The sea roared. But he did not flee."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "The monster never returned."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Then… where is"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Rannamaari?"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "And so, the story says, Malé changed forever."
  }
 ]
